        "title": "Apply FOIL on the RHS",
        "text": "Apply $$\\left(a+b\\right) \\left(c+d\\right)=ac+ad+bc+bd$$ \\n $$\\left(x-1\\right) \\left(x^2+1\\right)=x^3+x-x^2-1$$",
