        ],
        "title": "Move all terms to the LHS",
        "text": "$$x^3-2x+1=x^3+x-x^2-1$$ so we subtract $$x^3+x-x^2-1$$ from both sides. This is an application of $$a=b+c$$ iff $$a-c=b$$ with $$b=0$$.",
